       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    CMANREQ.
       AUTHOR.        C.I.HILLES/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
      *INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *DATE-WRITTEN.  NOVEMBER, 1983.
      *REMARKS.
      *D          THIS SUBPROG IS CALLED FROM MMIS PROGRAMS TO
      *D          CREATE REQUISITIONS FOR MMIS WORK ORDERS.
      *D          IT CREATES THE REQ IF IT DOESNT EXIST, OR MODIFIES
      *D          THE REQ IF IT ALREADY EXISTS
      *
      *           THE REQ-STATUS FIELD TELLS WHAT TYPE OF A REQ WE ARE
      *           DEALING WITH:
      *           "SS" - STOREROOM
      *           "SN" - CODED NON-STOREROOM
      *           "NM" - NON-CODED.
      *
      *C
      *C   05/05/94  JE COFFMAN  WRITTEN REQUEST 94-001/SLS REQ 6487
      *C     ADDED THE ABILITY TO ALLOW 'SS' STATUS REQUISITIONS
      *C     THAT HAVE THE AUTHORIZATION FLAG SET VIA MP1 TO BE
      *C     HANDLED.
      *C
      *C   MAY 1995 JE COFFMAN  WRITTEN REQUEST 93-032/SLS REQ 6563
      *C     ADDED THE LOGIC TO CAPTURE ALL REQUISITIONS THAT ARE
      *C     ADDED OR UPDATED FOR AKRON PLANTS SO THAT WE CAN
      *C     TRANSFER THE DATA AUTOMATICALLY TO CORPORATE AND
      *C     ELIMINATE DUPLICATION OF INPUT.
      *C
      *C   NOV 1995 JE COFFMAN
      *C     WHEN KELLY PLANTS WENT TO PRAPS REQUISITIONING ON 11/27/95
      *C     SOME CODE WAS ADDED TO NOT WRITE AN MREQFILE RECORD (MA1)
      *C     AND TO FORCE MMIS-GENERATED REQUISITIONS TO LOOK LIKE THEY
      *C     WENT STRAIGHT TO PURCHASING.
      *C
      *C   NOV 1996  CA YODER   REQ #96-027
      *C     ADDED CURRENCY CODE AND SECOND UNIT COST FIELDS TO DREQITM.
      *C
      *C   OCT 1997  JE COFFMAN
      *C     CHANGED THE LOGIC FOR COPYING A REQUISITION WITH A LONG
      *C     DESCRIPTION.
      *C
      *C   13FEB1998 WL MCINTYRE  REQ #98-002
      *C     ADD LOGIC TO RETAIN TAX-CODE FROM DREQITM BEFORE
      *C     DELETE IN ORDER TO INCLUDE ON REINSERT TO DREQITM.
      *C
      *C   OCT 1999  JE COFFMAN
      *C     ADDED ABILITY TO WRITE A REQUISITION RECORD TO MCORPREQ
      *C     FOR R/3. THIS SHOULD ONLY OCCUR WHEN THE ONLY APPROVER
      *C     IN THE PATH IS ALSO THE ORIGINATOR OF THE REQUISITION.
      *C
      *C   JUN 2000  JE COFFMAN
      *C     REPAIRED A PROBLEM WHEREBY THE BUDGET NUMBER WOULD GET
      *C     WIPED OUT WHEN A MODIFY FUNCTION WAS OCCURRING.
      *C
      *C   OCT 2001  CA YODER
      *C     COMMENTED OUT KELLY-SPECIFIC LOGIC CAUSING REQS TO
      *C     GO STRAIGHT TO PURCHASING.
      *C
      *C   APR 2002  CA YODER      (R3 REQUEST)
      *C     MODIFIED SO THAT REQS WITH REQ-AUTH-CODE-FLAG SET
      *C     TO "X" WOULD GO TO AN APPROVAL PATH.
      *C
      *C   MAR 2003  CA YODER
      *C     UM-COMMENTED OUT KELLY-SPECIFIC LOGIC CAUSING REQS TO
      *C     GO STRAIGHT TO PURCHASING FOR FAYETTEVILLE.  THEY ARE
      *C     NOT ON R/3 YET, SO THE REQS STILL NEED TO GO TO
      *C     PURCHASING.
      *C
      *C   MAY 2003  BE GEISER     (R3 REQUEST)
      *C     ADD REQ SERVICE FLAG TO IDENTIFY SERVICE REQS. DEFAULT
      *C     NEW REQ USERS TO NOT ACTIVE AT LEVEL 00, NOT ABLE TO
      *C     INQUIRE ON ALL REQS AND NOT ABLE TO DISPLAY DOLLARS.
      *C
      *C   DEC 2003  BE GEISER
      *C     COMMENTED OUT FAYETTEVILLE LOGIC FORCING REQS TO
      *C     GO STRAIGHT TO PURCHASING NOW THAT THEY ARE ON SAP/R3.
      *C
      *C   JUL 2004  BE GEISER     (R3 REQUEST)
      *C     MODIFIED SO THAT ALL REQS FOR SAP PLANTS ARE STATUS "NM".
      *C
      *C   MAR 2005  CA YODER      REQ #2005-60273
      *C     CHANGED MSTORERM LOGIC TO NOT OVERWRITE REQUISITION UNIT
      *C     OF MEASURE IF ONE WAS ALREADY PASSED FROM A CALLING
      *C     PROGRAM.  ALSO, CHANGE UNIT PRICE TO BE EXPRESSED IN
      *C     REQUISITION UNIT OF MEASURE.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MCORPREQ-RQ-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS5701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM-CD-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MEMPL-EM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MEMPL-EM-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MREQ-RQ-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2001
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DREQITM-RQ-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MREQFILE-CD-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2801
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DREQDESC-RQ-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DREQDESC-RQ-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DREQQUE-RQ-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS4401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT PER-PERSON-PC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DREQD-RQ-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      *------ FD SECTION FOR IBM ONLY ------*
